  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Translating to the left subtracts 4 from the x-coordinate: \\(2-4=-2\\). Translating upward adds 1 to the y-coordinate: \\(3+1=4\\). The new coordinates are \\((-2,4)\\).",
